Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "targetUserId": 1
}

### 3. 존재하지 않는 유저에게 언팔로우 (나 1번 -> 999번)
POST {{baseUrl}}/follows/destroy
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
